      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is this one needed? I don\u0027t see a serializable use of std::unique_ptr in ShaderModule.h. IMHO pointers are a nice barrier to denote what shouldn\u0027t be serialized so it would be nice to not add this.",
      "revId": "5667680a73b87cc37eaf56f0fcc7fd5171a58806",
