        "id": 3874508
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-12T11:42:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`EntryPointMetadataTable` itself is a map of entry point name -\u003e `unique_ptr\u003cEntryPointMetadata\u003e`. [1]\n\n```\nusing EntryPointMetadataTable \u003d\n    absl::flat_hash_map\u003cstd::string, std::unique_ptr\u003cEntryPointMetadata\u003e\u003e;\n```\n\nI think for items that should not get serialized we should have something like `UnsafeUnkeyed` wrapper, since currently raw pointer can also get serialized [2] (but not deserialized).\n\n[1]: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/ShaderModule.h;l\u003d105\n[2]: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/stream/Stream.h;l\u003d213",
      "parentUuid": "5d07e911_e3d5fe6c",
      "revId": "5667680a73b87cc37eaf56f0fcc7fd5171a58806",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
